  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 5 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPRE AUCTION NOTICE\r\nNEW DATE/TIME: Thursday 5 November 10am Lot 2\r\nVENUE: 8 The Promenade, Takapuna\r\n\r\nEffortless Living. Exceptional Location. Timeless Appeal.\r\n\r\nImagine a lifestyle where the beach, cafés and boutique shops are just an easy, level stroll from your front door. Welcome to this superbly positioned, spacious two-bedroom townhouse in the heart of Browns Bay, where comfort, privacy and effortless living come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nSolidly constructed in enduring brick, this appealing home offers a sense of permanence and peace of mind, complemented by an impressively generous living and dining area. Designed for relaxed everyday living and effortless entertaining, the spacious interiors flow seamlessly outdoors to sun-soaked decks and  garden, creating a wonderful extension of your living space.\r\n\r\nPrivately tucked away at the rear, the setting is a real highlight. Peaceful, sunny and secure, with a welcome sense of sanctuary from the outside world.\r\n\r\nAnd the location, Simply exceptional. Leave the car at home and wander down to Browns Bay Beach, enjoy your morning coffee at a favourite café, browse the local shops or soak up the vibrant seaside atmosphere. This is coastal living at its most convenient, with everything you love about the Bays right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to downsize without compromising on space, secure an easy-care home, invest in a sought-after location or simply embrace the lifestyle you have always wanted, this property delivers on every level.\r\n\r\nSpacious, sun-filled and superbly located. This is the kind of property that makes life easier and living more enjoyable.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a quality brick home in one of the North Shore’s most desirable coastal communities. Come and discover just how good life in Browns Bay can be.",
